## 4. What the live test proves
- the SQL applies on a fresh database (agos_v2_r202_test, created and dropped)
- the 16 invalid cases rejected by the contracts are rejected by the database too
- SQL columns == contract fields (tasks, steps, artifacts, messages); agent_specs.spec holds AgentSpec
- the example scenario (contracts/v2/examples) inserts via jsonb_populate_record and reads back into the contracts
- RLS: a member sees only their workspace; anon has no access; task_events is append-only;
  completing a task by UPDATE without verified_at is rejected

